		{"id":"c2424becfd7e4859","type":"text","text":"6. Merchant knows that even though if Aksara able to turn the power back on, Karma will definitely retaliate on sukawati","x":3170,"y":-417,"width":250,"height":197},
		{"id":"97e8fcca55525657","type":"text","text":"7. Aksara learnt accountability, and promises that she'll help them deal with the repercussions of this","x":2920,"y":-220,"width":250,"height":140},
		{"id":"07f0e1898008ead0","type":"text","text":"7. Kenari learnt to trust something she feared","x":2920,"y":-80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bf132a5cb3658b87","type":"text","text":"Merchant","x":3917,"y":-1431,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d3a3657b22f73b2b","type":"text","text":"Kenari","x":4257,"y":-1431,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"1472c2d6a6f26f34","type":"text","text":"Aksara","x":3580,"y":-1429,"width":250,"height":59,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"530b7bb5b0c20849","type":"text","text":"5. Aksara said she would gladly help, Merchant had found the help that he needed","x":2920,"y":-854,"width":250,"height":135},
		{"id":"1734d73dab8372b8","type":"text","text":"4. He deemed Aksara to have good intentions, he then lowers his guard","x":2920,"y":-719,"width":250,"height":135},
		{"id":"42b1047a422576e6","type":"text","text":"5. The cyborg wanted to help, there is a candidate of someone capable to carry out the mission to save her father","x":3170,"y":-719,"width":250,"height":135},
		{"id":"6ee5f1bf5e3dee6b","type":"text","text":"Aksara","x":1237,"y":-1468,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"70c62c5a6bc8b4ea","type":"text","text":"Kenari","x":2237,"y":-1368,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"47249ebba893a520","type":"text","text":"Merchant","x":1657,"y":-828,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cf3e470ee795aaf0","type":"text","text":"Father","x":1782,"y":-1828,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0a26fc983cb93d82","type":"text","text":"1","x":3460,"y":-1199,"width":50,"height":60},
		{"id":"d5248410f7e2385b","type":"text","text":"You're going to let her?!","x":4260,"y":-831,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"567357320d0f3f95","type":"text","text":"Take this. But you’ll need three more. Last I heard, scavengers spotted parts in the buildings nearby, I suggest you to look there.","x":3580,"y":-473,"width":250,"height":171,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"af2c9c0ca14cc8ca","type":"text","text":"That's simple enough, I can help you find it, and switch back the Solar Panel.","x":3580,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":83,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"045cce52ff91dd5b","type":"text","text":"But if you activate it, Sukawati will be in imminent danger. Power means defiance. She’ll send her troopers right away and wreak havoc in this peaceful place.","x":3580,"y":-217,"width":250,"height":206,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ce1096f51157d016","type":"text","text":"Then let her come. If Sukawati going to be punished for this, it won’t be on your hands. I’ll be here to face whatever she send.","x":3580,"y":-11,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6150a2e8f4e8e10d","type":"text","text":"Because I've seen enough suffering on my way here, I want to help.","x":3580,"y":-722,"width":250,"height":113,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a0cb4b3e9dcd5a85","type":"text","text":"All right. You’ve got the look of someone who means it. Let's discuss the details.","x":3580,"y":-609,"width":250,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d908c456f93cfa17","type":"text","text":"Why would you help us?! Why should I even trust you, cyborg?!","x":3580,"y":-827,"width":250,"height":105,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d1d0478617f2fd4f","type":"text","text":"Y-you—! Why are you here?!","x":3580,"y":-1233,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"89a5205f6abb5699","type":"text","text":"Now hold on. People get jumpy in these parts of this settlement.","x":3580,"y":-1170,"width":250,"height":98,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"53507856383e5fa8","type":"text","text":"I didn't mean to pry, but I can help you find the others.","x":3580,"y":-1293,"width":250,"height":55,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8b177c5a876899f0","type":"text","text":"You should know better than to stroll into a shop like this without a good reason, young lady.","x":3580,"y":-1068,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"3b50a904f899b78e","type":"text","text":"I heard His pacemaker is failing, you need electricty to charge it back. I can lend you a hand.","x":3580,"y":-948,"width":250,"height":117,"color":"4"}
	],
